T*
() Tj
T*
(Build images:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(docker compose build) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Start the stack:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(docker compose up -d) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Check status:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
